/target
/Cargo.lock.*
*.swp
.DS_Store
.envrc
.direnv/
.context/
/apps/muxa-macos/.build/
/apps/muxa-macos/dist/
/apps/muxa-macos/.derived-data/
/apps/muxa-macos/.qa-derived/
/apps/muxa-macos/*.xcresult/
/apps/muxa-macos/Muxa.xcodeproj/
# Claude Code's sub-agent isolation worktrees + local agent state — except
# skills meant to be shared with the repo, e.g. .claude/skills/muxa-bridge.
# (A bare `.claude/` prunes traversal entirely, so the negation below would
# never be consulted; `.claude/*` still ignores every top-level entry but
# lets git walk in far enough to see the re-include.)
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
!.claude/skills/**
